l to the state of Michoacán, except the: city of Morelia accessed by federal toll roads 15D, 126 and 43; and the federal toll road 48D between the city of Morelia and the General Francisco Mujica airport town of Pátzcuaro accessed by federal toll roads 14D and 15 from Morelia, and boat trips out to islands on Lake Pátzcuaro federal highway 15D Michoacán is one of Mexico’s most violent states with high levels of organised crime and very little security presence."},{"form":"against all but essential travel","text":"advises against all but essential travel to the areas south and south-west of Lake Chapala to the border state of Colima, specifically the municipalities of: Acatlán de Juárez Amacueca Ameca Atemajac de Brizuela Atengo Atenguillo Atoyac Autlán de Navarro Ayutla Casimiro Castillo Chiquilistlán Cocula Cuautitlán de García Barragán Cuautla Ejutla El Grullo El Limón Gómez Farias Guachinango Juchitlán Mixtlán San Gabriel San Marcos San Martín Hidalgo Sayula Tapalpa Techaluta de Montenegro Tecolotlán Tenamaxtlán Teocuitatlán de Corona Tolimán Tonaya Tuxcacuesco Tuxcueca Unión de Tula Villa Corona Villa Purificación Zacoalco de Torres Zapotitlán de Vadill Zapotlán el Grande FCDO advises against all but essential travel to the northern municipalities of: Bolaños Chimaltitán Colotlán Hostotipaquillo Huejúcar Huequilla el Alto Mezquitic San Martin de Bolaños Santa Maria de los Ángeles Totatiche Villa Guerrero This is due to inaccessibility for security forces, lack of state control, drugs cultivation and high levels of violence between rival criminal groups."},{"form":"against all but essential travel","text":"advises against all but essential travel to the whole state of Colima, except the city of Manzanillo accessed by sea or by air via Manzanillo-Costalegre International Airport, and direct travel via road 200 from the airport to Manzanillo."}],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/mexico","read":"2026-08-19","page_updated":"2026-07-16T16:08:09+01:00"}},"timing":{"peak":"Nov-Mar (El Norte kite/wind season) - highest occupancy, schools full, villas booked; whale + whale-shark window","shoulder":"Apr & Oct (wind tapering / fishing ramping; softer rates)","green":"May-early Nov (glass-calm offshore = billfish/dorado peak + summer tournaments; desert heat + hurricane window Jun-Nov)","booking_window_lead_time":"villas + fishing lodges for Nov-Mar wind season and summer tournament dates book 4-9 months ahead; tournament weeks (Dorado Shoot Out mid-July, East Cape Offshore) tightest; shoulder short-lead; verify current tournament dates","out_of_season_fill_the_beds":"Apr-May/Oct = calm-water Sea of Cortez beach town + snorkel/SUP + ATV + Cabo Pulmo day trips; La Paz whale-shark add-ons Oct-Apr; summer = glass-calm offshore fishing + tournament energy","holiday_event_peaks":"Christmas-New Year (peak wind + snowbird villas), Semana Santa, Mexican summer holidays; tournament weekends spike lodging hardest","campaign_start_trigger":"open kite/wind campaigns late summer (for Nov-Mar); open sportfishing/tournament campaigns late winter (for May-Nov); market kite and fishing audiences separately - opposite seasons","event_peaks":["El Norte kite/wind Nov-Mar","Dorado Shoot Out ~mid-July + East Cape Offshore / Bisbee''s opener","whale season Dec-Apr","La Paz whale sharks ~Oct-Apr"],"sources":["https://www.wahoowind.com/about","https://vanwormerresorts.com/sport-fishing","https://discoverbaja.com/2026/06/03/summer-2026-baja-fishing-tournaments/","https://sallysees.com/whale-watching-in-baja-california-sur/"]},"jewels":[{"name":"El Norte kiteboarding season (Nov-Mar)","si_tag":"Ocean Adventures","status":"future","tier":"premier","bookable":"Wahoo Wind Co. / Vela Baja lessons + rentals","source":"https://www.wahoowind.com/about","timing":"Nov-Mar","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"reliable 15–30 kt N/NE cross-wind on a protected sandy bay","si":"ocean","blurb":"reliable 15–30 kt N/NE cross-wind on a protected sandy bay","when":"Nov-Mar","commission":"kite-school operator on application + GYG affiliate"},{"name":"Wingfoil / windsurf clinics","si_tag":"Ocean Adventures","status":"future","tier":"premier","bookable":"local wind schools","source":"https://middlecasa.com/why-los-barriles-is-mexicos-winter-mecca-for-kitesurfers/","hook":"multi-day progression on the same El Norte wind","si":"ocean","blurb":"multi-day progression on the same El Norte wind","commission":"operator on application"},{"name":"Offshore billfish/dorado charter","si_tag":"Ocean Adventures","status":"future","tier":"premier","bookable":"Van Wormer fleet / Charter Maria Teresa","source":"https://vanwormerresorts.com/sport-fishing","timing":"Nov-Mar","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"ocean","when":"Nov-Mar","commission":"charter on application"},{"name":"Dorado Shoot Out tournament week","si_tag":"Ocean Adventures","status":"future","tier":"premier","bookable":"tournament entry + Palmas de Cortez lodging","source":"https://discoverbaja.com/2026/06/03/summer-2026-baja-fishing-tournaments/","timing":"Nov-Mar","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"~mid-July, ~140 boats, largest dorado tournament in Baja","si":"ocean","blurb":"~mid-July, ~140 boats, largest dorado tournament in Baja","when":"Nov-Mar","commission":"lodge/charter on application"},{"name":"ATV / off-road desert + beach run","si_tag":"GEA","status":"live","tier":"comfort","bookable":"Los Barriles Adventures / local ATV operators","source":"https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g1544261-d23230066-Reviews-Los_Barriles_Adventures-Los_Barriles_Baja_California.html","hook":"quad rides into the sierra to remote beaches, snorkel coves, historic lighthouse","si":"expedition","blurb":"quad rides into the sierra to remote beaches, snorkel coves, historic lighthouse","commission":"operator + Viator affiliate"},{"name":"Winter whale watching (offshore)","si_tag":"GEA","status":"live","tier":"comfort","bookable":"local boat operators / Amstar","source":"https://sallysees.com/whale-watching-in-baja-california-sur/","si":"expedition","commission":"operator + affiliate"},{"name":"La Paz whale-shark day trip","si_tag":"GEA","status":"live","tier":"premier","bookable":"La Paz operator day trip + transfer","source":"https://www.cabopulmopark.com/","si":"expedition","commission":"operator + Viator affiliate"},{"name":"Calm-water Sea of Cortez beach day (off-wind season)","si_tag":"Tropical Islands","status":"future","tier":"comfort","bookable":"villa + local SUP/snorkel rental","source":"https://www.globeguide.ca/travel-guide-los-barriles-mexico/","hook":"swim/snorkel/SUP the warm gulf when El Norte is down","si":"tropical","blurb":"swim/snorkel/SUP the warm gulf when El Norte is down","commission":"rental + villa"}],"faq":[{"q":"When is kiteboarding season in Los Barriles?","a":"November 1 to the end of March, when the \"El Norte\" wind blows a reliable 15–30 kt N/NE crosswind, building mid-morning and peaking in the afternoon. The wide, protected sandy bay suits all levels — book instructors and beachfront villas 4–9 months out.","source":"wahoowind.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"ocean"},{"q":"When is the fishing best, and what''s the big tournament?","a":"Offshore peaks May to early November in glass-calm water for marlin, dorado, wahoo and tuna, and the marquee event is the mid-July Dorado Shoot Out — ~140 boats, Baja''s largest dorado tournament. Kite and fishing are opposite seasons, so plan for one or the other.","source":"vanwormerresorts.com / discoverbaja.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"ocean"},{"q":"What else is there beyond wind and fish?","a":"Winter whale-watching (Dec–Apr) offshore, ATV desert-and-beach runs year-round, and the La Paz whale-shark snorkel ~40 minutes north (Oct–Apr). Off the wind season (Apr–Oct) the Sea of Cortez turns calm for swimming, snorkel and SUP.","source":"sallysees.com / globeguide.ca, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"expedition"},{"q":"Is kiteboarding here dangerous?","a":"It''s for the prepared — the core hazard is offshore drift. El Norte''s 15–30 kt N/NE wind is side-offshore, so a downed kiter drifts toward open sea; take lessons with a school running rescue-boat cover, use the right kite size and self-rescue skills, and check the daily wind before launch.","source":"wahoowind.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"safety"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Los Barriles Mexico: Kiteboarding, Fishing & El Norte Winds 2026","meta_description":"Los Barriles on Baja''s East Cape — El Norte kiteboarding season (Nov–Mar), world-class marlin/dorado sportfishing, villas, ATV desert runs and the gateway to Cabo Pulmo.","slug":"los-barriles-mexico","primary_keyword":"Los Barriles kiteboarding","long_tail":["Los Barriles El Norte wind season","Los Barriles sportfishing dorado marlin","Dorado Shoot Out tournament Los Barriles","Los Barriles East Cape villa rentals","kitesurfing Los Barriles vs La Ventana"],"search_language":["en","es-MX"],"local_keywords":["Los Barriles kitesurf temporada El Norte","pesca deportiva Los Barriles dorado marlin","torneo Dorado Shoot Out Los Barriles","villas renta Los Barriles Baja","clases de kite Los Barriles","qué hacer en Los Barriles","Los Barriles cómo llegar desde Los Cabos"],"hreflang":["en","es-MX"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","author_byline":"By David McCallister — commercial pilot, 56 countries","content_freshness":"2026-07-04"},"booking":null,"si_checklist_25":null,"sis_present":[{"si":"ocean","status":"future"},{"si":"GEA (Great Escapes & Adventures)","status":"live"},{"si":"tropical","status":"future"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Hotel Palmas de Cortez (Van Wormer)","posture":"premier fishing resort + tournament host in-town; not five-star brand","price_tier":"premier","earning":"on application via host / DMC","virtuoso_value_add":"n/a-branded - treat as premier fishing lodge","mor":"no net-rate resale","source":"https://vanwormerresorts.com/"},{"name":"Premier beachfront villas (Punta Pescadero / Los Barriles)","posture":"top private-stay rung locally for wind-week/fishing groups","price_tier":"luxury","earning":"on application via host / villa manager","virtuoso_value_add":"private villa + kite/fishing days brought in","mor":"agency terms, no net-rate resale","source":"https://abajavacation.com/"}],"source_verified":"2026-07-04","hero":{"query":"Los Barriles, Mexico"},"geo":{"lat":23.682,"lng":-109.696}}'::jsonb, 60),
