erais-2/","timing":"Dry season Apr–Sep — best for cobblestone walking, mountain roads, mine tours, churches, hiking","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"car-light historic core, art galleries on the Rota dos Atêlieres, horse-drawn wagon rides, boutique pousadas; Minas''s most intimate romantic base","si":"romance","blurb":"car-light historic core, art galleries on the Rota dos Atêlieres, horse-drawn wagon rides, boutique pousadas; Minas''s most intimate romantic base","when":"Dry season Apr–Sep — best for cobblestone walking, mountain roads, mine tours, churches, hiking","commission":"pousada/villa + DMC"},{"name":"Maria-Fumaça steam train (Tiradentes ↔ São João del-Rei)","si_tag":"romance","tier":"essential","source":"https://www.civitatis.com/en/ouro-preto/sao-joao-rei-tiradentes-maria-fumaca/","timing":"Dry season Apr–Sep — best for cobblestone walking, mountain roads, mine tours, churches, hiking","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"vintage steam locomotive, 12 km through 19th-century countryside, weekends only; a slow, romantic set-piece","si":"romance","blurb":"vintage steam locomotive, 12 km through 19th-century countryside, weekends only; a slow, romantic set-piece","when":"Dry season Apr–Sep — best for cobblestone walking, mountain roads, mine tours, churches, hiking","commission":"tour affiliate / DMC; face-value fare non-commissionable"},{"name":"São João del-Rei baroque + railway heritage","si_tag":"romance","tier":"essential","source":"https://www.footlooselemonjuice.com/tiradentes-minas-gerais-2/","timing":"Dry season Apr–Sep — best for cobblestone walking, mountain roads, mine tours, churches, hiking","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"Aleijadinho-attributed São Francisco de Assis church, the railway roundhouse & museum, Tancredo Neves Memorial, Solar dos Neves. A cultured half-day paired with Tiradentes","si":"romance","blurb":"Aleijadinho-attributed São Francisco de Assis church, the railway roundhouse & museum, Tancredo Neves Memorial, Solar dos Neves. A cultured half-day paired with Tiradentes","when":"Dry season Apr–Sep — best for cobblestone walking, mountain roads, mine tours, churches, hiking","commission":"DMC half-day; museum/church entry non-commissionable"},{"name":"Fazenda-stay countryside + prospector trails","si_tag":"romance","tier":"comfort","source":"https://www.theultimatetravelcompany.co.uk/south-america/brazil/ouro-preto-minas-gerais","timing":"Dry season Apr–Sep — best for cobblestone walking, mountain roads, mine tours, churches, hiking","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"working/historic farm estates around Tiradentes and the Serra circuit; ride or walk trails once cut by gold prospectors, swim beneath waterfalls","si":"romance","blurb":"working/historic farm estates around Tiradentes and the Serra circuit; ride or walk trails once cut by gold prospectors, swim beneath waterfalls","when":"Dry season Apr–Sep — best for cobblestone walking, mountain roads, mine tours, churches, hiking","commission":"villa/fazenda MoR + DMC"},{"name":"Mineiro comfort-food circuit (pão de queijo, feijão-tropeiro, tutu)","si_tag":"culinary","tier":"essential","source":"https://foodandroad.com/what-to-eat-in-minas-gerais-traditional-foods/","timing":"year-round","timing_type":"ALWAYS-ON","si":"culinary","when":"year-round","commission":"DMC food-experience / tour affiliate; restaurants direct"},{"name":"Artisanal cachaça trail","si_tag":"culinary","tier":"essential","source":"https://foodandroad.com/what-to-eat-in-minas-gerais-traditional-foods/","timing":"Dry season Apr–Sep — best for cobblestone walking, mountain roads, mine tours, churches, hiking","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"Minas is Brazil''s largest producer of artisanal cachaça; the tropeiros carried Paraty cachaça up the Royal Road and it arrived already aged","si":"culinary","blurb":"Minas is Brazil''s largest producer of artisanal cachaça; the tropeiros carried Paraty cachaça up the Royal Road and it arrived already aged","when":"Dry season Apr–Sep — best for cobblestone walking, mountain roads, mine tours, churches, hiking","commission":"DMC/tour affiliate; distilleries direct"},{"name":"Tiradentes Festival de Cultura e Gastronomia","si_tag":"culinary","tier":"premier","source":"https://oquefazeremtiradentes.com.br/2026/28o-festival-de-cultura-e-gastronomia-de-tiradentes/","timing":"Dry season Apr–Sep — best for cobblestone walking, mountain roads, mine tours, churches, hiking","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"28th edition 21–30 Aug 2026; celebrated chefs, tasting menus, classes, shows; Condé Nast-recognized among the world''s best places to eat 2026","si":"culinary","blurb":"28th edition 21–30 Aug 2026; celebrated chefs, tasting menus, classes, shows; Condé Nast-recognized among the world''s best places to eat 2026","when":"Dry season Apr–Sep — best for cobblestone walking, mountain roads, mine tours, churches, hiking","commission":"DMC festival package carries margin"},{"name":"Serra do Caraça sanctuary (hikes + maned-wolf feeding)","si_tag":"adventure","tier":"comfort","source":"https://www.serradocaraca.com.br/en/serra-do-caraca-turismo-servicos-e-informacoes-da-regiao-english/","timing":"Dry season Apr–Sep — best for cobblestone walking, mountain roads, mine tours, churches, hiking","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"adventure","when":"Dry season Apr–Sep — best for cobblestone walking, mountain roads, mine tours, churches, hiking","commission":"DMC / lodge; guided hikes via operator"},{"name":"Serra do Cipó National Park","si_tag":"adventure","tier":"comfort","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Serra_do_Cip%C3%B3_National_Park","timi