y FCDO advises against travel ."},{"form":"against all but essential travel","text":"advises against all but essential travel: along the Amazonas (Amazon) River and its tributaries west of the town of Codajás and east of the town of Belém do Solimões in Amazonas State along any part of the Itaquaí River in Amazonas State along any part of the Japurá River or its tributaries in Amazonas State along the Rio Negro (Black River) and its tributaries north or west of the town of Barcelos in Amazonas State There are risks to travellers in river areas towards the west of Amazonas State, where Brazil shares borders with Colombia, Peru and Venezuela, due to criminal activity."}],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/brazil","read":"2026-08-19","page_updated":"2026-05-11T12:32:48+01:00"}},"timing":{"peak":"Dry season Jul-Oct; jaguar optimum late Jul-early Oct; strongest Aug-Sep","birding":"year-round; jabiru nesting Jul-early Nov; wading-bird flocks late Jul-mid-Aug","high_water_green_season":"Dec-Mar (rivers highest, jaguars dispersed, lush + cheaper)","inflection":"demand loads 6+ months ahead of dry season; premium Porto Jofre beds scarce","fire_date":"curve-start minus 1-2 weeks; fire in Nov-Jan of prior season for the Jul-Oct jaguar peak","advance_book_note":"jaguar-season lodges (floating suites, mobile camps, top river lodges) book 6+ months out for Aug-Sep","off_season_fill":"green season Dec-Mar sold on price + birding + photography + fewer boats"},"jewels":[{"name":"Porto Jofre jaguar boat safari","si_tag":"safari","tier":"premier","source":"https://www.flashpackerconnect.com/blog/the-ultimate-guide-to-jaguar-viewing-tours-in-brazils-pantanal","timing":"Dry season Jul-Oct","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"Small open boats on the Cuiabá/Piquirí/Três Irmãos rivers. Guide-required","si":"safari","blurb":"Small open boats on the Cuiabá/Piquirí/Três Irmãos rivers. Guide-required","when":"Dry season Jul-Oct","commission":"operator/DMC packaged boat-safari + full-board lodge"},{"name":"Transpantaneira road safari (Poconé to Porto Jofre)","si_tag":"safari","tier":"comfort","source":"https://www.oneroadtrip.com/itineraries/br-mato-grosso-pantanal-nord-jaguar-6j.html","timing":"year-round","timing_type":"ALWAYS-ON","hook":"The 147 km / 122-bridge causeway is itself a rolling game drive — caiman, capybara, jabiru, tapir, and macaw from the vehicle","si":"safari","blurb":"The 147 km / 122-bridge causeway is itself a rolling game drive — caiman, capybara, jabiru, tapir, and macaw from the vehicle","when":"year-round","commission":"DMC transfer-as-safari + Transpantaneira lodges"},{"name":"Giant otter tracking","si_tag":"safari","tier":"comfort","source":"https://www.pantanaljaguarsafaris.com/best-time-to-visit","timing":"Dry season Jul-Oct","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"Giant otters seen daily and close-range on the rivers June–December — a charismatic, near-guaranteed dry-season jewel","si":"safari","blurb":"Giant otters seen daily and close-range on the rivers June–December — a charismatic, near-guaranteed dry-season jewel","when":"Dry season Jul-Oct","commission":"lodge boat-safari program"},{"name":"Night drive (nocturnal wildlife)","si_tag":"safari","tier":"comfort","source":"https://www.brazilnaturetours.com/vacation-packages/pantanal","timing":"Dry season Jul-Oct","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"Spotlight drives for ocelot, tapir, and nightlife the day misses","si":"safari","blurb":"Spotlight drives for ocelot, tapir, and nightlife the day misses","when":"Dry season Jul-Oct","commission":"lodge-included activity"},{"name":"Horseback pantaneiro ride (Southern)","si_tag":"safari","tier":"premier","source":"https://www.amazonadventures.com/caiman-ecological-refuge.html","timing":"Dry season Jul-Oct","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"Ride the open grassland with the working cowboys — a genuine Southern-Pantanal signature","si":"safari","blurb":"Ride the open grassland with the working cowboys — a genuine Southern-Pantanal signature","when":"Dry season Jul-Oct","commission":"lodge-included / Southern DMC"},{"name":"Caiman & capybara mega-concentrations","si_tag":"safari","tier":"essential","source":"https://www.wildlifeworldwide.com/locations/the-pantanal","timing":"Dry season Jul-Oct","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"The thousands-strong yacaré caiman gatherings and the ubiquitous capybara are the base layer of every drive and boat — the wetland''s signature density","si":"safari","blurb":"The thousands-strong yacaré caiman gatherings and the ubiquitous capybara are the base layer of every drive and boat — the wetland''s signature density","when":"Dry season Jul-Oct","commission":"included in every lodge program"},{"name":"Mobile tented jaguar camp","si_tag":"expedition","tier":"premier","source":"https://www.pantanaljaguarsafaris.com/","timing":"Dry season Jul-Oct","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"Expedition-style tented camping in the heart of the jaguar zone — the harder-core, closer-to-the-wild alternative to a fixed lodge","si":"expedition","blurb":"Expedition-style tented camping in the heart of the jaguar zone — the harder-core, closer-to-the-wild alternative to a fixed lodge","when":"Dry season Jul-Oct","commission":"specialist expedition-operator net"},{"name":"Self-drive Transpantaneira expedition","si_tag":"expedition","tier":"essential","source":"https://www.wildjunket.com/pantanal-jaguar-safari-brazil/","timing":"year-round","timing_type":"ALWAYS-ON","hook":"The DIY edge-of-the-map drive — 4x4, fuel from Poconé, 122 bridges, no services. A GEA-flavored adventure for the self-sufficient traveler","si":"expedition","blurb":"The DIY edge-of-the-map drive — 4x4, fuel from Poconé, 122 bridges, no services. A GEA-flavored adventure for the self-sufficient traveler","when":"year-round","commission":"4x4 rental + a-la-carte lodge nights (thin; sell insurance attach)"},{"name":"Hyacinth macaw viewing","si_tag":"wildlife","tier":"premier","source":"https://www.scottdunn.com/us/brazil/hotels/araras-eco-lodge","timing":"Dry season Jul-Oct","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"The world''s largest flying parrot, reliably seen around Northern lodges like Araras — an electric-blue signature bird","si":"wildlife","blurb":"The world''s largest flying parrot, reliably seen around Northern lodges like Araras — an electric-blue signature bird","when":"Dry season Jul-Oct","commission":"lodge-included birding activity"},{"name":"Jabiru stork nesting & wading-bird flocks","si_tag":"wildlife","tier":"comfort","source":"https://www.pantanaljaguarsafaris.com/best-time-to-visit","hook":"Jabiru nesting Jul–early Nov; massive wading-bird gatherings late Jul–mid-Aug. A world-class birding jewel","si":"wildlife","blurb":"Jabiru nesting Jul–early Nov; massive wading-bird gatherings late Jul–mid-Aug. A world-class birding jewel","commission":"birding-specialist DMC / lodge program"},{"name":"Piranha fishing","si_tag":"wildlife","tier":"essential","source":"https://www.brazilnaturetours.com/vacation-packages/pantanal","timing":"Dry season Jul-Oct","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"wildlife","when":"Dry season Jul-Oct","commission":"lodge-included excursion"},{"name":"650+ bird / 120+ mammal biodiversity immersion","si_tag":"wildlife","tier":"comfort","source":"https://www.wildlifeworldwide.com/locations/the-pantanal","timing":"Dry season Jul-Oct","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"For the dedicated naturalist, the sheer species list is the jewel — multi-day birding-and-mammal itineraries across both Pantanals","si":"wildlife","blurb":"For the dedicated naturalist, the sheer species list is the jewel — multi-day birding-and-mammal itineraries across both Pantanals","when":"Dry season Jul-Oct","commission":"birding-specialist DMC multi-day land package"}],"faq":[{"q":"When is the best time to see jaguars in the Pantanal?","a":"The dry season, roughly June–October, is the whole game: falling water concentrates wildlife on the riverbanks, and late July through early October is the optimum, with August–September the strongest months — Porto Jofre boat-safari sightings run 80–90% over a multi-day trip.","source":"pantanaljaguarsafaris.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"safari"},{"q":"Can you self-drive the Transpantaneira?","a":"Yes, but it''s higher-risk and guided is strongly preferred: a 4x4 is recommended for the 122 wooden bridges, you must fill fuel in Poconé because there are no stations after it, and with no services or cell coverage you must plan the medevac gap yourself.","source":"wildjunket.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"expedition"},{"q":"Is the Pantanal good for birding?","a":"Exceptionally, and year-round: the wetland lists 650+ bird species, with jabiru storks nesting July–early November and the biggest wading-bird flocks gathering late July to mid-August — a birding counterweight that props up the shoulders of the jaguar season.","source":"wildlifeworldwide.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"wildlife"},{"q":"Can the Pantanal work for a honeymoon?","a":"Yes, as a wild-honeymoon rather than a beach one: SouthWild''s Jaguar Suites are 30 m² glass-walled floating rooms with AC and WiFi anchored in the jaguar zone, boats leaving from the deck — private guiding and sundowners over the wetland for the couple who wants adventure over sand.","source":"southwild.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"romance"},{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for in the Pantanal?","a":"Wildfire in the late dry season: 2020 fires burned about 31% of the wetland and affected roughly 45% of the jaguar population, and 2024 brought the worst fire count since records began in 1999 — well over a million hectares. Monitor fire and air-quality conditions for late-dry departures and keep flexible-rebooking language in the flow.","source":"news.mongabay.com, 2026-07-07; fireandsafetyjournalamericas.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"Do I need vaccinations or malaria pills for the Pantanal?","a":"It''s zone-dependent: CDC notes malaria risk in parts of the state of Mato Grosso (Northern Pantanal) but not in Cuiabá city or Mato Grosso do Sul (Southern Pantanal), so route the health note by access door; yellow-fever vaccination is recommended for Mato Grosso, and dengue/chikungunya precautions apply regardless of malaria zone.","source":"jmbeetravelhealth.com, 2026-07-07; cdc.gov, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"safety"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"The Pantanal, Brazil — World''s Best Jaguar Safari & Wildlife Wetland | TravelWell.World","meta_description":"Plan a Pantanal jaguar safari: the world''s best wild-jaguar viewing at Porto Jofre, dry-season timing, Northern vs Southern access, eco-lodges by tier, and safety. Freely bookable.","search_language":"pt-BR","long_tail_en":["best time to see jaguars in the Pantanal","Pantanal jaguar safari Porto Jofre","Transpantaneira road self-drive","Northern vs Southern Pantanal","Pantanal eco lodges by tier","hyacinth macaw Pantanal birding","jaguar flotel Porto Jofre","Caiman Ecological Refuge Onçafari"],"local_keywords":["Pantanal onças","safári de onça-pintada","Porto Jofre","Transpantaneira","onça-pintada Pantanal","melhor época para ver onças no Pantanal","pousadas Pantanal","arara-azul Pantanal","Pantanal norte e sul"],"hreflang":["en","pt-BR"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","author_byline":"By David McCallister — commercial pilot, 56 countries","freshness":"2026-07-07","primary_keyword":"The Pantanal"},"booking":null,"si_checklist_25":null,"sis_present":[{"si":"safari","status":"live"},{"si":"wildlife","status":"live"},{"si":"